OL,3,GNEWSAThe unlikely friendship in a mill
OL,4,A- now they have been reunited
OL,5,
OL,6,FFifty years ago, a boarding
OL,7,Fschool-educated photographer fresh out
OL,8,Fof art school travelled to the north of
OL,9,FEngland to capture the dying breaths of
OL,10,FLancashire's cotton mills.
OL,12,FDaniel Meadows, who was 23 at the time,
OL,13,Fmet Stanley Challenger Graham, then
OL,14,Faged 40, at Bancroft Mill in
OL,15,FBarnoldswick.
OL,17,FThe two men forged an unlikely
OL,18,Ffriendship and now they have been
OL,19,Freunited for a special reunion on BBC
OL,20,FBreakfast.
OL,23,APub: 14-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,404,400,260,160,0,100
