OL,3,GNEWSAThe unlikely friendship in a mill
OL,4,A- now they have been reunited
OL,5,
OL,6,F"I was definitely working class," said
OL,7,F90-year-old Stanley, who was given the
OL,8,Fnickname "The High Priest of Steam" by
OL,9,FDaniel.
